  "description": "Cloud-native HttpClient extensions for .NET microservices. Distributes connections across multiple HttpClient instances to spread load over Kubernetes pods backing a single Service, provides production-ready SocketsHttpHandler defaults, error-handling JSON verb helpers, and a small route-template builder. Composes with Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience (Polly v8) for retry/circuit-breaker.",
